      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, comparing to `common_mobile_full.mk` you removed:\n* `Camelot` - PDF viewer, seems worth it to keep to me...\n* `Etar` - Eh, sure, kill it I guess but I see no reason to disclude it - I suppose an argument can be made.\n* `Profiles` - Still _very_ valid IMO?\n* `Glimpse` - Doesn\u0027t that break a lot of things having no gallery or image editor?\n* `Recorder` - Still _very_ valid IMO? - Screen recording games.\n* `Seedvault` - Backup, rather useful.\n* `Twelve` - Music player - seems still useful to me.\n* `Aperture` - Sure, kill it.\n\nThis was also removed, which should be restored if Recorder is:\n```\n# Media\nPRODUCT_PRODUCT_PROPERTIES +\u003d \\\n    media.recorder.show_manufacturer_and_model\u003dtrue\n```\n\nIf we include `common_mobile` directly you get most of what you want.\n\nI think refactoring this to to copy `common_mobile_full.mk` -\u003e `common_handheld_console.mk`, and keep inheriting `common_mobile.mk` makes way more sense.",
